 "items": [
  {
   "team": "MIA",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Dolphins put QB Malik Willis on injured reserve with a groin injury, so he misses at least Weeks 10 to 13. Kyle McCord, a 2025 sixth-round pick, is in line for his first NFL start Sunday at Indianapolis. The model now rates Miami with McCord through Week 13.",
   "src": "NFL.com, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://www.nfl.com/news/dolphins-place-qb-malik-willis-groin-on-injured-reserve-kyle-mccord-in-line-for-first-start"
  },
  {
   "team": "BUF",
   "tag": "Result",
   "text": "Bills 23, Vikings 6. Buffalo controlled the ball for 42 minutes and forced three Minnesota turnovers; Carson Wentz and the Vikings managed 178 yards and two field goals. The model's locked pick, Buffalo at 56%, won. Its spread side (Vikings +3.5) and total (Over 45.5) both lost.",
   "src": "Final score and team stats, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/game/_/gameId/401873051/bills-vikings"
  },
  {
   "team": "MIN",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "Minnesota traded a 2027 third-round pick to Las Vegas for Kirk Cousins, two days after Carson Wentz went 8 of 25 against Buffalo. Cousins is expected to start Sunday at Green Bay, and the model now uses him as the Vikings' starter, which moves that game toward Minnesota. Rookie Fernando Mendoza takes over in Las Vegas.",
   "src": "NBC Bay Area / ESPN, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://www.nbcbayarea.com/news/sports/nfl/vikings-kirk-cousins-trade-raiders/4173444/"
  },
  {
   "team": "SF",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "San Francisco got WR Keenan Allen from Indianapolis for a 2027 sixth-round pick. Allen leads the Colts with 40 catches. He's moved to the 49ers in the projections; his numbers there use his Colts role, so they're rough until he plays a game in San Francisco.",
   "src": "ESPN, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50444457/sources-49ers-acquire-keenan-allen-trade-colts"
  },
  {
   "team": "BUF",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "Buffalo filled its safety need with Amani Hooker from Tennessee.",
   "src": "ESPN, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50444810/bills-trade-titans-safety-amani-hooker"
  },
  {
   "team": "CIN",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "Cincinnati called off its agreed trade for Eagles edge rusher Arnold Ebiketie over the compensatory-pick formula. He stays in Philadelphia.",
   "src": "ESPN, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50443891/bengals-nix-agreed-trade-eagles-sources-say"
  },
  {
   "team": "MIA",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "DT Zach Sieler needs season-ending biceps surgery.",
   "src": "ProFootballTalk, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://www.nbcsports.com/nfl/profootballtalk/rumor-mill/news/2026-nfl-trade-deadline-live-updates-tracker-deals-news-rumors-analysis"
  },
  {
   "team": "LAC",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Good news for the Chargers: imaging on Justin Herbert's left middle finger came back negative, with no fracture.",
   "src": "DK Network, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://dknetwork.draftkings.com/2026/11/10/nfl-injury-report-week-10/"
  },
  {
   "team": "KC",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Patrick Mahomes (right elbow strain) and Xavier Worthy (hamstring) are day-to-day. The model still has Mahomes starting at Atlanta.",
   "src": "DK Network, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://dknetwork.draftkings.com/2026/11/10/nfl-injury-report-week-10/"
  },
  {
   "team": "NYJ",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Garrett Wilson is in the concussion protocol and must clear it to play Buffalo.",
   "src": "DK Network, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://dknetwork.draftkings.com/2026/11/10/nfl-injury-report-week-10/"
  },
  {
   "team": "GB",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Guard Sean Rhyan is out at least a month with a high ankle sprain, and Josh Jacobs needs surgery on a fractured finger. Both count against Green Bay.",
   "src": "DK Network, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://dknetwork.draftkings.com/2026/11/10/nfl-injury-report-week-10/"
  },
  {
   "team": "ARI",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "WR Michael Wilson is out for the season with a fractured vertebra, suffered on Arizona's fourth offensive play against Seattle. He had 51 catches for 546 yards and was on pace for a second straight 1,000-yard season. He's off the fantasy rankings, and his snaps count against Arizona.",
   "src": "ESPN, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50435608/cardinals-wr-michael-wilson-neck-miss-rest-season"
  },
  {
   "team": "ARI",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Gardner Minshew likely tore the UCL in his throwing arm and may need season-ending surgery. Rookie Carson Beck is expected to start Sunday against the Rams. With no NFL passing history, the model rates him as a typical new starter, which lowers Arizona's chances.",
   "src": "ESPN, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50435608/cardinals-wr-michael-wilson-neck-miss-rest-season"
  },
  {
   "team": "NE",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Rhamondre Stevenson is expected to miss time with a knee tendon issue. He's off the fantasy rankings for Week 10.",
   "src": "ESPN, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50435734/bills-vikings-josh-allen-carson-wentz-mnf"
  },
  {
   "team": "LA",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Puka Nacua has MCL and PCL sprains in his right knee plus turf toe, and Sean McVay says he'll likely go on injured reserve. That means at least four games; with the Week 11 bye, Dec. 20 at Dallas is the earliest return. He's out of the fantasy rankings and his snaps now count in the Rams' injury load.",
   "src": "Larry Brown Sports (via NFL Network), Nov 9",
   "url": "https://larrybrownsports.com/football/rams-news-puka-nacua-injury/777778"
  },
  {
   "team": "JAX",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "Jacksonville made three defensive trades in one day: DT Jordan Davis from Philadelphia (2027 first-round and 2029 second-round picks), S Jessie Bates from Atlanta (2027 second, 2028 fifth) and DT Davon Godchaux from New Orleans. Their old teams now count them as missing; Jacksonville\u2019s ratings catch up as they play.",
   "src": "ESPN, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50435639/jaguars-get-eagles-jordan-davis-blockbuster-trade"
  },
  {
   "team": "DAL",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "TE Jake Ferguson and RB Tyler Goodson will miss multiple weeks, and S P.J. Locke is out for Sunday against San Francisco, per Brian Schottenheimer. George Pickens and Kavontae Turpin are among those to be decided later in the week.",
   "src": "A to Z Sports, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://atozsports.com/nfl/dallas-cowboys-news/injury-updates-jake-ferguson-tyler-goodson-pj-locke/"
  },
  {
   "team": "DET",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "Detroit acquired S Andre Cisco from the Jets for a 2028 sixth-round pick.",
   "src": "Detroit News, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://detroitnews.com/story/sports/nfl/lions/2026/11/09/detroit-lions-trade-andre-cisco-stats-new-york-jets-safety/92693765007"
  },
  {
   "team": "CLE",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Deshaun Watson cleared the concussion protocol and is expected to start Sunday against Houston. The model now uses Watson instead of Shedeur Sanders.",
   "src": "NFL.com news roundup, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.nfl.com/news/nfl-news-roundup-latest-league-updates-from-monday-nov-9"
  },
  {
   "team": "SEA",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Mike Macdonald ruled Sam Darnold out for Sunday at Las Vegas; he's still recovering from quad and rib injuries and could return after the Week 11 bye. Drew Lock starts again, playing through an oblique injury. If Lock can't go, rookie Jalen Milroe is next.",
   "src": "The Sunday Guardian, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://sundayguardianlive.com/sports/nfl-injury-update-sam-darnold-ruled-out-of-seahawks-vs-las-vegas-raiders-week-10-clash-drew-lock-to-start-320272/"
  },
  {
   "team": "NYG",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "J.J. McCarthy has a hip pointer but is expected to play Thursday against Washington. RB Cam Skattebo should be back from his hamstring injury.",
   "src": "NFL.com news roundup, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.nfl.com/news/nfl-news-roundup-latest-league-updates-from-monday-nov-9"
  },
  {
   "team": "GB",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Josh Jacobs is expected to miss up to three weeks. He's removed from projections, and his snaps now count in Green Bay's injury load.",
   "src": "Yahoo Sports NFL live updates, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/nfl/live/nfl-news-injury-updates-trade-deadline-rumors-131950109.html"
  },
  {
   "team": "NE",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "A.J. Brown has missed two games; the Patriots plan for him to travel to Germany for Sunday's game against Detroit, with no final decision. Lineman Ben Brown won't make the trip.",
   "src": "NFL.com news roundup, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.nfl.com/news/nfl-news-roundup-latest-league-updates-from-monday-nov-9"
  },
  {
   "team": "IND",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "The deadline passed with Jonathan Taylor still a Colt; Indianapolis reportedly turned down second-round picks. He stays the Colts' workhorse, now with Keenan Allen gone to San Francisco.",
   "src": "USA TODAY Sports via Yahoo, Nov 10",
   "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/jonathan-taylor-staying-colts-203756681.html"
  }
 ],
